 "remarks": "Move right into this beautifully updated two-bedroom brick-front townhouse, offering turnkey living in a convenient Stamford location. Hardwood floors and recessed lighting carry through the main level, where a comfortable living room flows into the dining area and out to a gated deck surrounded by mature greenery. The fully renovated kitchen features white shaker cabinetry, quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a breakfast peninsula ideal for casual dining. A newly updated powder room and electrical panel add to the home's thoughtful improvements. Upstairs, two well-proportioned bedrooms each feature brand-new AC units installed in 2026 and share a full bath with a double vanity. Side-by-side laundry is conveniently located on the bedroom level, along with a new hot water heater installed in 2026. Outside, the deck steps down to a level lawn, creating an inviting space for morning coffee, grilling, or relaxing outdoors. A low cost, well-managed HOA, assigned parking, and a pet-friendly association add to the ease of ownership. All just minutes from downtown Stamford's restaurants and shops, Metro-North, and the Merritt Parkway.",
